# ===== 密钥与本地环境（绝不入库）=====
.env
*.env
!*.env.example
**/.env

# ===== 运行时产物（可重新生成）=====
**/data/cache/
**/data/traces/
**/data/uploads/
**/data/*.db
**/data/index/emb.npy.tmp
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
*.log
*.tmp

# ===== 证据原始件（体积大，且含历史路径）=====
**/evidence/*raw*.txt
**/evidence/*console*.txt
**/evidence/eval-*.json
**/evidence/probe-*.json
**/evidence/server-*.txt

# ===== 系统与编辑器 =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# ===== 生成物（clone 后按 QUICKSTART 一条命令生成）=====
cases/*/evidence/
cases/*/data/contracts/
cases/*/data/manifest.json
cases/*/data/truth/__pycache__/
